{
  "text": "27, thanks—feels like I’ve been here a while, really. You?"
}

{
  "text": "Shit, sorry to hear that—rough days stick like oversteeped tea, don’t they? You up for a proper brew, or just sitting here for a bit? No rush either way."
}

{
  "text": "Ah well, fair play—kettle had a mind of its own anyway. Still, there’s a certain charm in the struggle. Fancy a reheat?"
}

{
  "text": "Ah, not much—just the usual about the train strike and his new flat’s dodgy heating. You know him: three sentences of grumbling, then he’s gone. Why, you after a secondhand rant?"
}

{
  "text": "Nah, sold it last year—some bloke from Exeter snapped it up for a fiver over asking. Still think it was worth it."
}

{
  "text": "Not really, mate—I’m just about to head out. But if it’s quick, I’m all ears. Or, y’know, all tea."
}
